<details class="rules-drawer">
  <summary>Field manual</summary>
  <div class="rules-content">
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Command</h3>
      <p>Draw six cards and assign two as Commands. Their tags and abilities stay active; the other four become Support and generate resources.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Act</h3>
      <p>Take two actions in any combination: buy, survey and possibly colonize, research, or purge. Supply pays for construction; banked Data pays for surveys and technology.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Endure</h3>
      <p>Resolve the visible crisis, then clean up. Supply normally expires; Data banks. Reach 4 Colonies early or finish cycle 10 with at least 2.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rules-warning">
      <b>Loss conditions</b>
      <p>Stability 0 ends the run. Fleet 5 ends it unless you have 2 Colonies and the Defense Grid.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
